Excelerate Learning Hub
A Flutter mobile application developed during the Excelerate Mobile App Development with Flutter Virtual Internship.

Project Overview
Excelerate Learning Hub is a mobile application designed to help learners discover opportunities, access program information, and provide feedback through an intuitive and user-friendly platform.

The project was developed across four weeks and evolved from low-fidelity wireframes into a functional Flutter application featuring navigation, dynamic data integration, state management, validation, loading indicators, and error handling.

The goal was to create a responsive mobile experience that simplifies opportunity discovery while demonstrating real-world Flutter development practices.

Project Objectives
Provide learners with easy access to opportunities and announcements.
Present program information through dynamic content.
Support user engagement through feedback collection.
Demonstrate Flutter development concepts including state management and data handling.
Build a portfolio-ready mobile application.
