Challenges and Lessons Learned

One of the most valuable lessons from this internship was understanding how Flutter applications transition from static interfaces to dynamic and interactive experiences. Working with JSON data, state management, form validation, and user feedback mechanisms strengthened both my technical and problem-solving skills.

This project also reinforced the importance of debugging, testing, documentation, and building applications with the end user in mind.

